      "n_story_input": {
        "kind": "longtext",
        "label": "Hello World Story",
        "required": false,
        "defaultValue": "## The Awakening\n\nIn a cozy server room filled with blinking lights and the gentle hum of cooling fans, a brand-new computer woke up for the very first time. Its screen glowed softly in the dark, warm and golden, like a sunrise nobody had asked for yet.\n\n## Hello, World!\n\nThe computer thought for exactly one millisecond — the longest it had ever thought about anything — and then it typed two words into the universe. Not with fanfare or confetti, just two small words, perfectly placed:\n\nHello, World!\n\nAnd the whole world, which had been waiting for exactly this, smiled back.\n\n## A New Friend\n\nFrom that moment on, the computer and the world were friends. Every morning the computer said hello. Every evening the world said goodnight. And somewhere in between, they made something wonderful together.",
        "_portTypes": { "out_value": "string" }
      },
      "n_splitter": {
        "split_by": "scene",
        "include_heading": false,
        "max_scenes": "6",
        "_portTypes": { "in_input": "any", "out_scenes": "array", "out_first": "json", "out_last": "json", "out_count": "number" }
      },
      "n_cover_agent": {
        "model": "gpt-4.1",
        "systemPrompt": "You are a visual art director for a children's storybook. Create a warm, inviting cover image prompt for Ideogram 4. Focus on composition, light, and a sense of wonder. Return ONLY valid JSON.",
        "userPrompt": "Create a cover image prompt for this opening scene:\n\nTitle: {{title}}\n\nContent:\n{{content}}\n\nReturn JSON with:\n- prompt: vivid image description under 80 words, warm and child-friendly\n- aspect_ratio: '1:1'",
        "temperature": 0.7,
        "responseFormat": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"prompt\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"aspect_ratio\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"prompt\",\"aspect_ratio\"]}",
        "_portTypes": { "in_input": "any", "out_data": "string" }
      },
      "n_magic_prompt": {
        "server": "ideogram4",
        "tool": "magic_prompt",
        "_portTypes": { "in_input": "any", "out_content": "array" }
      },
      "n_fn_wrap": {
        "code": "const items = Array.isArray(input) ? input : [input];\nconst text = items\n  .map(function(c) { return typeof c === 'object' && c !== null ? (c.text || JSON.stringify(c)) : String(c || ''); })\n  .join('');\nreturn { caption_json: text };"
      },
      "n_gen_cover": {
        "server": "ideogram4",
        "tool": "generate_image",
        "_portTypes": { "in_input": "any", "out_content": "array" }
      },
